WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
We search for what the task asks.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sometimes an unexpected detail is missed,
even by experts in a carefully designed experiment.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Looking is not always the same as reporting.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That finding concerns attention.
It does not test meditation audio.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying, try twelve quiet minutes.
Note your own experience privately.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then check the exact package, independent evidence,
and current merchant terms. The choice is yours.
